						<h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
							Error-Free Billing
						</h3>
						<p class="text-gray-700 text-base leading-relaxed">
							Error-free billing with automated validation
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="outcome-card bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-orange-100 rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8 border-2 border-orange-200">
						<div class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-orange-600 mb-3">✓</div>
						<h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
							Audit-Ready Records
